ONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;미국, Univ. of Hartford, Hart School Artist Diploma 취득</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 브니엘 예술고 및 영남대 성악과 전공실기 강사 등 역임</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;오페라 : 람메르무어의 루치아, 나비부인, 라보엠, 라 트라비아타, 피가로의 결혼, 춘향전 등 주역 출연&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
